DESCRIPTION:Ultra Gobi AlUla marks the first international chapter of the legendary endurance series\, bringing its two-decade legacy to the Kingdom's desert landscapes. Across distances from 30km to 400km\, athletes traverse open desert\, dramatic rock formations\, and ancient trade routes. Supported by world-class race infrastructure\, this is a journey through endurance\, history\, and place.
